---
description: Bind each use request to contributing items, transformation, channel, audience and duration.
args: { dossier: RightsDossier; change: RightsChange }
returns: ProposedCollectionUse[]
---
Represent print, web, preview, exhibit and promotional uses as distinct channels. Bind each derivative to every source item it contains and the planned audience and duration. A composite asset inherits the restrictions of every contributing item.
